# Replay

The package contains deterministic producer scripts under `scripts/` and their expected result hashes in `EXPECTED_RESULTS.sha256`.

```bash
PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 replay.py --check
python3 verify_package.py
```

`replay.py --check` reruns every scientific producer except the registry builder, rebuilds the registry, and compares every JSON result against its frozen SHA-256.  The RNG scout uses a fixed seed.
